SASRec
------

Files: sim/agents/sasrec_model.py

`sim/agents/sasrec_model.py` is a derived port of SASRec. The backbone follows
the reference implementations closely; the rating head, the rating-context
injection and the joint objective are additions specific to this project.

Method:
  Wang-Cheng Kang and Julian McAuley.
  "Self-Attentive Sequential Recommendation."
  IEEE International Conference on Data Mining (ICDM), 2018.

Sources consulted:
  kang205/SASRec           https://github.com/kang205/SASRec
    The TensorFlow original, behind the published numbers.
    Apache License 2.0.

  pmixer/SASRec.pytorch    https://github.com/pmixer/SASRec.pytorch
    The PyTorch port, and the authoritative reference for this port because
    the target is PyTorch.
    Apache License 2.0.

Both are Apache-2.0 licensed, which permits derived works provided the licence
and attribution are retained. Divergences between the two references, and the
choice made at each, are documented in the module docstring of
`sim/agents/sasrec_model.py`.
